 "description": "Compare up to 12 supplied six-digit hex colors or standard color names with a portable selected palette. Unknown or ambiguous names request hex values. Return the nearest digital swatch with a fixed RGB rule and concise rationale. This does not assess skin, photos, fabrics or garments you own.",
